T1  - What is (More) ethical in AI when ethical principles compete? Prioritization, LLM behavior, and governance gaps
AU  - Kotzanikolaou, Panayiotis
AU  - Dasaklis, Thomas K.
AU  - Christodoulakis, Vassilis
AU  - Malamas, Vangelis
