T1  - AMART: A multi-agent reflective framework for detecting and correcting faithfulness errors in translation
AU  - Li, Jiahe
AU  - Zhu, Shaolin
AU  - Xiong, Deyi
JO  - Information Processing & Management
VL  - 63
IS  - 7, Part A
SP  - 104819
PY  - 2026
