TY  - JOUR
T1  - SaBER-LLMs: Security-aware behavior embedding representation via large language models for fine-grained malware analysis
AU  - Jing, Chao
AU  - Wu, Yun
AU  - Cui, Chaoyuan
JO  - Neurocomputing
VL  - 680
SP  - 133234
PY  - 2026
